OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy day in the north with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain at times. Brighter
OL,7,Fto the far northeast of Scotland.
OL,8,FElsewhere, sunshine and frequent
OL,9,Fsqually showers. These heavy with the
OL,10,Fodd rumble of thunder and hail. Mild
OL,11,Fin the south.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FSpells of rain continuing in
OL,14,Fthe north, with clearest skies in
OL,15,FScotland and a frost. Further bands of
OL,16,Fheavy showers in the south, becoming
OL,17,Forganised over with hail and thunder.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
