OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA cold start in Scotland
OL,6,Fwith sunshine. Cloudier in the north
OL,7,Fagain with rain only gradually
OL,8,Fclearing southwards during the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Heavy showers, merging into
OL,10,Frain persisting in the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
